Description: build against the system's libzint, offline
 Debian ships libzint (libzint-dev), so the copy of Zint in external/zint is
 removed from the source (Files-Excluded) and the extension links the
 system library; generate-enums.py reads the system's zint.h. Also offline:
 no vcpkg (which clones from GitHub at configure time) and no type stub
 (generate-stub.py needs pybind11-stubgen, installed with pip at configure
 time). The build requirements are lowered to what Debian has
 (scikit-build-core 0.11, pybind11 2.13), and -Werror is dropped.
Author: Joshua Hirsig <tavletta@joshuahirsig.xyz>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-17
